  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Timor-Leste-Institutional Building for Veterans Policy Implementation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objectives of this grant are: (i) development of a national policy on veterans commensurate with national resourcescomma including public consultation during the drafting stage. (ii) drafting legislation on veterans for submission to Parliament. (iii) developing a strategy for poicy implementation commensurate with the staff and budget capacity of the VAUcomma including a review of administrationcomma staffing rolescomma and operational procuedurescomma and the creation of policy implementation guidelines. (iv) carrying out a skills-strengthening program for staff which encompasses both technical and mangement skillscomma for example database managementcomma outreach and communicationcomma program managementcomma and monitoring.  Given the proposed focus on assisting veterans to access Government and NGO social servicescomma liaison skills will be a priority area. The purpose of the grant is to assist the Recipient in developing a National Policy on Veterans and a strategy for its implementation.</narrative>
  </description>
